---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
---
<Base title="The Engine — DeathOvers"><Navbar />
<main class="analytics-page">
  <section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow"><span></span> THE DEATHOVERS ENGINE</div><h1>CRICKET ISN'T ONE<br /><em>20-OVER STORY.</em></h1><p class="hero-copy">We read the match in phases: what this ground normally demands, what the first innings revealed, and whether a chase is keeping pace with this specific target.</p><div class="hero-stats"><div><strong>22,479</strong><span>parsed matches</span></div><div><strong>5,095</strong><span>successful chases modelled</span></div><div><strong>684</strong><span>venue-format chase samples</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="section intro"><div class="section-label">01 / WHAT WE MEASURE</div><h2>EVERY INNINGS HAS<br />THREE DIFFERENT GAMES.</h2><p>We split limited-overs cricket into the Powerplay, Middle and Death. Each phase has its own scoring pattern, wicket risk and tactical job.</p><div class="phase-grid"><article class="phase-card powerplay"><div class="phase-number">01–06</div><h3>POWERPLAY</h3><p>Field restrictions. Fast starts, new-ball pressure and the first read on the pitch.</p><span>ARE WE SETTING THE TEMPO?</span></article><article class="phase-card middle"><div class="phase-number">07–15</div><h3>MIDDLE</h3><p>Control versus intent. This is where platforms either build or the asking rate starts to bite.</p><span>ARE WE BUILDING ENOUGH?</span></article><article class="phase-card death"><div class="phase-number">16–20</div><h3>DEATH</h3><p>Execution under pressure. Finishers, specialist bowlers and the value of every ball.</p><span>CAN THIS TOTAL BE WON?</span></article></div></section>
  <section class="section split-section"><div><div class="section-label">02 / FIRST INNINGS</div><h2>THE HISTORICAL<br />BENCHMARK.</h2><p>When a side bats first, we compare each phase to previous matches at the same ground and in the same format.</p><ul class="checks"><li>Venue scoring pattern</li><li>Phase run rate and wickets</li><li>Projected finish using the remaining phases</li></ul></div><div class="scorecard"><div class="card-top"><span>1ST INNINGS / EXAMPLE</span><b>VENUE PAR: 172</b></div><div class="phase-row"><span>POWERPLAY</span><strong>46/1</strong><small>PAR 45/1</small><i class="good">+2%</i></div><div class="phase-row"><span>MIDDLE</span><strong>68/3</strong><small>PAR 71/3</small><i>-4%</i></div><div class="phase-row"><span>DEATH</span><strong>58/2</strong><small>PAR 50/2</small><i class="good">+16%</i></div><div class="verdict">PROJECTED FINISH <b>178–186</b></div></div></section>
  <section class="section chase-section"><div class="section-label">03 / SECOND INNINGS</div><h2>A CHASE NEEDS A<br /><em>DIFFERENT BENCHMARK.</em></h2><p class="wide-copy">A 45-run Powerplay means something very different when chasing 130 than when chasing 190. Our Phase engine starts with successful chases at this venue, then adjusts the target for how the first innings actually played.</p><div class="formula"><span>HISTORICAL PHASE TARGET</span><b>×</b><span>FIRST-INNINGS PITCH SIGNAL</span><b>=</b><strong>LIVE PHASE GOAL</strong></div><div class="chase-example"><div class="chase-head"><span>CHASE TARGET</span><b>186</b><small>Venue: Wankhede · IPL</small></div><div class="target-line"><span>POWERPLAY</span><div class="track"><i style="width: 56%"></i></div><b>56</b><small>historical 52 · adjusted +8%</small></div><div class="target-line"><span>MIDDLE</span><div class="track"><i style="width: 76%"></i></div><b>75</b><small>historical 71 · adjusted +6%</small></div><div class="target-line"><span>DEATH</span><div class="track"><i style="width: 74%"></i></div><b>74</b><small>historical 63 · adjusted +17%</small></div></div></section>
  <section class="section confidence"><div class="section-label">04 / DATA YOU CAN TRUST</div><div class="confidence-grid"><div><h2>WE DON'T PRETEND<br />TO KNOW.</h2><p>Every displayed comparison has a venue sample behind it. When the evidence is too thin, we show less—not more.</p></div><div class="rules"><div><b>✓</b><span><strong>Same venue, same format</strong>We do not mix an ODI ground profile with a T20 benchmark.</span></div><div><b>✓</b><span><strong>Successful chases only</strong>Chase phase targets come from sides that actually reached their target.</span></div><div><b>✓</b><span><strong>Rain-adjusted matches excluded</strong>DLS, VJD and other adjusted results do not enter the model.</span></div><div><b>✓</b><span><strong>Sample size shown</strong>Every target tells you how many comparable chases support it.</span></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="closing"><div class="eyebrow"><span></span> NOT JUST THE SCORE</div><h2>KNOW <em>WHEN</em> THE MATCH<br />IS BEING WON.</h2><a href="/">OPEN LIVE MATCHES →</a></section>
</main></Base>
<style>
.analytics-page{padding:44px 24px 70px;overflow:hidden}.hero{padding:24px 0 54px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(240,242,245,.12)}.eyebrow,.section-label{color:var(--bail-amber);font:700 10px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.11em}.eyebrow span{display:inline-block;width:22px;height:2px;background:var(--blood-red);vertical-align:middle;margin:0 8px 2px 0}h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-weight:400;line-height:.94;letter-spacing:.025em}h1{font-size:clamp(56px,10vw,100px);margin:20px 0}h2{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,64px);margin:14px 0 16px}h3{font-size:27px}em{color:var(--blood-red);font-style:normal}p{color:rgba(240,242,245,.68);font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;max-width:620px}.hero-copy{font-size:17px}.hero-stats{display:flex;margin-top:36px}.hero-stats div{padding:0 32px;border-left:1px solid rgba(240,242,245,.15)}.hero-stats div:first-child{padding-left:0;border:0}.hero-stats strong{display:block;font:40px 'Bebas Neue';color:#fff}.hero-stats span{font:10px 'JetBrains Mono';color:rgba(240,242,245,.48);text-transform:uppercase}.section{padding:66px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(240,242,245,.1)}.intro>p{margin-bottom:25px}.phase-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}.phase-card{min-height:250px;padding:22px;background:var(--outfield);border-top:3px solid rgba(240,242,245,.2)}.powerplay{border-color:var(--bail-amber)}.middle{border-color:#7795d3}.death{border-color:var(--blood-red)}.phase-number{font:11px 'JetBrains Mono';color:rgba(240,242,245,.45);margin-bottom:34px}.phase-card p{font-size:13px;margin:12px 0 20px}.phase-card span{font:9px 'JetBrains Mono';color:var(--bail-amber)}.split-section,.confidence-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}.checks{list-style:none;margin-top:22px}.checks li{padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(240,242,245,.1);font-size:13px}.checks li:before{content:'+';color:var(--blood-red);font-weight:700;margin-right:10px}.scorecard{background:#10131a;border:1px solid rgba(240,242,245,.14);padding:19px}.card-top,.phase-row,.verdict{display:flex;align-items:center}.card-top{justify-content:space-between;padding-bottom:14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(240,242,245,.13);font:10px 'JetBrains Mono';color:rgba(240,242,245,.55)}.card-top b{color:var(--bail-amber)}.phase-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr .65fr .7fr .4fr;padding:15px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(240,242,245,.08);font:12px 'JetBrains Mono'}.phase-row strong{color:#fff}.phase-row small{color:rgba(240,242,245,.48)}.phase-row i{color:#f07c7c;font-style:normal}.phase-row i.good{color:#66d49d}.verdict{justify-content:space-between;padding-top:18px;font:10px 'JetBrains Mono';color:rgba(240,242,245,.55)}.verdict b{font-size:20px;color:#fff}.wide-copy{max-width:760px}.formula{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin:30px 0;padding:16px;border:1px dashed rgba(240,242,245,.22);font:10px 'JetBrains Mono';color:rgba(240,242,245,.56)}.formula b{color:var(--blood-red);font-size:20px}.formula strong{color:var(--bail-amber)}.chase-example{background:var(--outfield);padding:22px}.chase-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;padding-bottom:15px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(240,242,245,.1);font:11px 'JetBrains Mono';color:rgba(240,242,245,.55)}.chase-head b{font:35px 'Bebas Neue';color:#fff}.chase-head small{margin-left:auto}.target-line{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 34px 220px;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:17px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(240,242,245,.06);font:11px 'JetBrains Mono'}.target-line span{color:var(--bail-amber)}.target-line b{font-size:18px;color:#fff}.target-line small{color:rgba(240,242,245,.48)}.track{height:7px;background:#272d37}.track i{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blood-red),var(--bail-amber))}.rules{display:grid;gap:12px}.rules div{display:flex;gap:12px;padding:13px;background:var(--outfield)}.rules b{color:#6ed6a3;font:18px 'JetBrains Mono'}.rules strong{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:3px}.rules span{font-size:12px;color:rgba(240,242,245,.55);line-height:1.45}.closing{text-align:center;padding:70px 0 15px}.closing h2{font-size:clamp(45px,8vw,76px);margin:18px 0 28px}.closing a{display:inline-block;padding:13px 17px;background:var(--blood-red);color:white;text-decoration:none;font:700 11px 'JetBrains Mono';letter-spacing:.07em}@media(max-width:680px){.analytics-page{padding:30px 16px 50px}.hero-stats{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px}.hero-stats div{padding:0 16px}.hero-stats strong{font-size:31px}.phase-grid,.split-section,.confidence-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:15px}.section{padding:48px 0}.phase-card{min-height:0}.formula{display:block;line-height:2}.target-line{grid-template-columns:82px 1fr 28px}.target-line small{grid-column:2/5;font-size:9px}.chase-head small{display:none}.phase-row{grid-template-columns:1.1fr .7fr .8fr .4fr;font-size:10px}}
</style>
